Third-party content
--------------------------------------------------------------------
None. This software has zero runtime dependencies: the PDF, DOCX,
XLSX, HWPX and CSV parsers, the DOCX/XLSX generators, the charting
and the cryptographic hash chain are all implemented in this
repository and run in the browser without any external library or
network request.
